            "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's only a Fun Project, that's the reason there are only subtitles</h2></strong><br><br><strong>Stockwrk7</strong> is a small (and short(!)) first person adventure game with horror elements and puzzles that the player has to solve in order to escape the 7th floor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features of <strong>Stockwrk7</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 130 voicelines for a harmonious atmosphere.<br></li><li>Over twenty different Interactive Objects.<br></li><li>Areas worked out with love with high-resolution 3D models.<br></li><li>Combining objects and find clues to solve the cryptic puzzles.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the project <strong>Stockwrk7</strong></h2><br>The aim of this project was to learn new things. The idea itself of building a (small) horror adventure game came up in a stream in the summer of 2022 and since I would be lost without deadlines, the goal was Halloween 2022.<br>Due to the lack of time (always after work), no A/AA title should be expected.<br>You can follow the work on the project or on new projects on <strong>Twitch -&gt; GudeAndi </strong>.<br><br><strong>It's only a Fun Project, that's the Reason there isn't a translation.</strong><br><br>The assets are primarily sourced from Quixel/EpidemicSound/Epic Marketplace.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supporters</h2>The voice output is by cOrnY.<br><br>Various 3D models from Derabo1.",
            "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's only a Fun Project, that's the reason there are only subtitles</h2></strong><br><br><strong>Stockwrk7</strong> is a small (and short(!)) first person adventure game with horror elements and puzzles that the player has to solve in order to escape the 7th floor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features of <strong>Stockwrk7</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 130 voicelines for a harmonious atmosphere.<br></li><li>Over twenty different Interactive Objects.<br></li><li>Areas worked out with love with high-resolution 3D models.<br></li><li>Combining objects and find clues to solve the cryptic puzzles.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the project <strong>Stockwrk7</strong></h2><br>The aim of this project was to learn new things. The idea itself of building a (small) horror adventure game came up in a stream in the summer of 2022 and since I would be lost without deadlines, the goal was Halloween 2022.<br>Due to the lack of time (always after work), no A/AA title should be expected.<br>You can follow the work on the project or on new projects on <strong>Twitch -&gt; GudeAndi </strong>.<br><br><strong>It's only a Fun Project, that's the Reason there isn't a translation.</strong><br><br>The assets are primarily sourced from Quixel/EpidemicSound/Epic Marketplace.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supporters</h2>The voice output is by cOrnY.<br><br>Various 3D models from Derabo1.",
